      · simpa only [literalConstAddLoan, if_pos rfl] using
          literalConstAdd_phys (L.low.drop 3) (L.carry.take 251) (L.low.getD 2 0) L.one (k / 8) hndLit
      · rw [mappedAddLoan_zero]
